cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "To cite these seals, please use the metadata below."
type: dataset
title: "Forecast seals: GSS 2026, CES 2026 and Gallup October 2026"
authors:
  - name: "Nate Grotberg"
abstract: >-
  Seal files for model-generated forecasts of the 2026 General Social Survey and the
  2026 Cooperative Election Study. Each seal is a sha256 digest over every forecast row
  for one survey wave (protocol forecast-seal-1), sealed on 2026-09-07 and submitted to
  OpenTimestamps on 2026-09-23. The repository includes the OpenTimestamps proofs and a
  standard-library Python verifier. The forecasts are model-generated predictions, not
  measurements.
keywords:
  - forecast
  - timestamping
  - OpenTimestamps
  - General Social Survey
  - Cooperative Election Study
